{
  name: "item-liquid-teleport",
  displayName: "Item Liquid Teleport",
  author: "namds666 & Claude Code & Codex",
  subtitle: "v1.4.20: Chrono Build Towers build in parallel",
  description: "Cheat-grade Chrono blocks for global item and liquid transport, terrain and item conversion, repair, construction, overdrive, unit buffs and debuffs, mind control, and core placement, plus the Outpost, a base that builds mining drones.\n\n[accent]v1.4.20[]\nEach Chrono Build Tower now takes its own plan from your build queue, so more towers build more blocks at the same time. They also build your plans when you are far away.\n\n[accent]v1.4.19[]\nYuri's range is now 60 tiles, up from 30.\n\n[accent]v1.4.18[]\nYuri now finds targets within its own 30 tile range around itself, so it keeps converting wherever it walks. Upgrades now only shorten the channel time.\n\n[accent]v1.4.17[]\nChrono Hypno is now 1x1. Four in a 2x2 square merge into a Big Chrono Hypno, whose Big Yuri tethers two targets at once. More Yuri on one target convert it faster: two Yuri take half the time.\n\n[accent]v1.4.16[]\nShorter mod description with changes listed by version.",
  version: "1.4.20",
  minGameVersion: "146"
}
